        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu na gumwe ogw'omu busingye bwa Asa omugabe wa Yuda, Omuri akatandika kutegyeka Israeli, yaategyekyera emyaka ikumi n'ebiri; omuri egyo yaamara emyaka mukaaga naategyekyera Tiruza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
